{"LOL":{"dna16":"8800763988000012","senses":[{"def":"Laughing (or laugh) out loud.","dna16":"8800763988000129","ex":["I just saw the video where he opens the door and gets the surprise! LOL!","Bro got milk spilt over his head! LOL!"],"id":"wikt:LOL:interjection:1","pos":"interjection","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":[],"tags":["Internet"]},{"def":"Lots of laughs. (occasionally used)","dna16":"8800763988000228","ex":["I love the one where he orders a cup of tea but then chaos ensues! LOL!"],"id":"wikt:LOL:interjection:2","pos":"interjection","src":"wikt","sym":"19:1","syn":[],"tags":["Internet"]},{"def":"Indicates light-heartedness or amusement, or that the accompanying statement is not intended as serious; sometimes extends to irony or sardonicism, in the same way that spoken humor sometimes does. Often now a discourse marker independent of laughter.","dna16":"8800763988000327","ex":["I hope you weren't expecting a welcome wagon, LOL.","In the course of managing your expectations, you'll need to account for the usual amount of pettiness and dishonesty among your fellow humans lol."],"id":"wikt:LOL:interjection:3","pos":"interjection","src":"wikt","sym":"3:1,18:1,19:2,60:1,79:1","syn":[],"tags":["Internet","figuratively"]},{"def":"Lots of love.","dna16":"8800763988000426","ex":["P.S.: Give my regards to Elizabeth and to the children! LOL!"],"id":"wikt:LOL:interjection:4","pos":"interjection","src":"wikt","sym":"","syn":[],"tags":["dated"]},{"def":"Loyal Orange Lodge, a prefix given to all branches of the Loyal Orange Order. For example, LOL 1 is Portadown branch.","dna16":"8800763988000525","ex":[],"id":"wikt:LOL:noun:5","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"2:1,38:1","syn":[],"tags":["Commonwealth","Ireland","US"]},{"def":"Little old lady.","dna16":"8800763988000624","ex":["We've got an LOL in the emergency department who seems a bit confused."],"id":"wikt:LOL:noun:6","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"17:1","syn":[],"tags":["derogatory","informal","sometimes"]},{"def":"An ins